      "id": 138269,
      "name": "grysqrl",
      "username": "grysqrl",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-29T17:48:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Lost in the Past causes you to lose if there are no cards in the environment trash. This gives you another way to get a card into that trash. It is also useful if you know something nasty is on top of the environment deck and want to get rid of it.</p><p>Edit: I guess you could use also use it to accelerate an Akash'Bhuta flip. So, there are a few very specific cases where this is useful, but most of the time people probably don't discard for it.</p>",
